<title>USA: High Plains Wheat - Basis mixed, demand still slow.</title>
<headline>High Plains Wheat - Basis mixed, demand still slow.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basis bids for hard red winter wheat were mixed Thursday as recent weaker trends showed signs of slowing but demand remained sluggish, grain dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;I think the last couple of days it (the basis) has stabilized a bit but people are fearful of a continuation (of the fall),&quot; a Kansas dealer said.</p>
<p>&quot;We are not seeing much on the (export) sale side and the mills are well covered,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>Farmer sales were reported to be slow.  </p>
